<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB cuts Shell,Royal Dutch.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CSFB cuts Shell,Royal Dutch.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Transport and Trading Co Plc and Royal Dutch Petroleum were cut to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at CS First Boston, the investment bank said on Monday.</p>
<p>Analysts at CSFB said the stocks had reached their target valuations after recent share price performance, adding that the group was one of the most heavily exposed of all the oil majors to the chemical sector and would be affected by the downturn they expect in the second half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
